= Implementation and Results <ch:implementation>
This chapter explains the implementation, the evaluation procedure, and the results.
It is required in the final report; an incomplete version may be included in FYDP-1.

== Environment Setup
Record operating systems, tool versions, dependencies, hardware, data sources,
and the commands needed to reproduce the work.

== Testing and Evaluation
Describe test cases, baselines, metrics, datasets, and the evaluation protocol.
Explain limitations and potential sources of bias.

== Results and Discussion
Present measured results and compare them with the objectives and prior work.
Do not invent results to fill the template.

== Summary
Summarize the implementation and the evidence for the reported outcomes.
